post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'
Ancient Evil needs the files of the original game (not included).
Copy the installed game folder (the one with RPG.EXE, GAMEDAT, LEVELS and
WAV) to ~/.local/share/ancientevil, or start it with --game-dir DIR.
For speech, movies and music copy the CD into a folder named "cd" inside it.
MSG
}
